1
00:00:04,625 --> 00:00:10,750
As Saruman's evil is washed away,
we send a clear message to Mordor.

2
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:17,667
Men are not so weak yet that they are powerless
to resist the Dark Lord's will entirely.

3
00:00:20,083 --> 00:00:23,583
The ruin of Isengard will
prove to be a setback,

4
00:00:23,958 --> 00:00:27,333
but we would be fools to
believe it a deterrent.

5
00:00:30,708 --> 00:00:33,375
Sauron's power grows by the day.

6
00:00:33,917 --> 00:00:36,375
Soon he will be ready to strike.

7
00:00:37,333 --> 00:00:40,833
Our only advantage now lies in his hubris.

8
00:00:41,292 --> 00:00:43,375
We must force his hand

9
00:00:43,708 --> 00:00:47,208
and make him believe that we
will use the Ring against him.

10
00:00:55,458 --> 00:01:00,875
Tonight we remember those who gave
their blood to defend this country.

11
00:01:01,667 --> 00:01:04,208
Hail the victorious dead!

12
00:01:04,292 --> 00:01:05,375
Hail!

13
00:01:18,875 --> 00:01:21,000
No news of Frodo?

14
00:01:21,542 --> 00:01:24,417
No word. Nothing.

15
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:29,750
What does your heart tell you?

16
00:01:36,375 --> 00:01:38,500
That Frodo is alive.

17
00:01:42,250 --> 00:01:43,375
Yes.

18
00:01:46,542 --> 00:01:48,292
Yes, he's alive.

19
00:02:02,292 --> 00:02:03,792
What are you doing?

20
00:02:05,167 --> 00:02:07,208
Pippin, are you mad?

21
00:02:07,292 --> 00:02:10,292
I just want to look at it.
Just one more time.

22
00:02:10,542 --> 00:02:11,875
Put it back.

23
00:02:16,375 --> 00:02:18,167
Pippin!

24
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:30,300
I see you.
